# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# StreamlineExtract - Multi-Provider LLM Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# This system supports multiple LLM providers via LiteLLM:
# - OpenAI (gpt-4o, gpt-4o-mini, o1, gpt-5)
# - Azure OpenAI (Azure-hosted OpenAI models)
# - Anthropic Claude (claude-3.5-sonnet, claude-3-opus, claude-3-haiku)
# - Google Gemini (gemini-1.5-pro, gemini-1.5-flash, gemini-2.0-flash)
# - And 100+ other models
#
# IMPORTANT: Copy this file to `.env` and uncomment ONE provider section below
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION 1: Azure OpenAI (Recommended for Enterprise)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Higher rate limits, better SLAs, data residency control
#
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your-azure-api-key-here
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION=2025-04-01-preview
# AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource.openai.azure.com/
#
# Available Azure OpenAI Models (use your deployment name):
# AZURE_OPENAI_MODEL=your-gpt-4.1-deployment
# AZURE_OPENAI_MODEL=your-gpt-4o-deployment
# AZURE_OPENAI_MODEL=your-gpt-5-deployment
# AZURE_OPENAI_MODEL=your-gpt-5-mini-deployment

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION 2: OpenAI (Standard)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Direct OpenAI API access
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-openai-api-key-here
#
# Available Models:
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o              # Best quality, higher cost
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini         # Best value (DEFAULT)
# OPENAI_MODEL=o1-preview          # Advanced reasoning
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5               # Latest flagship (if available)

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION 3: Anthropic Claude
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Strong reasoning, large context windows (200K tokens)
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-anthropic-api-key-here
#
# Available Models:
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3.5-sonnet  # Best overall (RECOMMENDED)
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3-opus      # Highest capability
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3-haiku     # Fastest, cheapest

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION 4: Google Gemini
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Multimodal capabilities, very competitive pricing
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-google-api-key-here
# # OR
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your-google-api-key-here
#
# Available Models:
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-pro      # Best quality
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash    # Fast and cheap
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash    # Latest version

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION 5: Other Providers (via LiteLLM)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LiteLLM supports 100+ providers. Examples:
#
# # AWS Bedrock
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-aws-access-key
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-aws-secret-key
# AWS_REGION_NAME=us-east-1
#
# # Hugging Face
# HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=your-hf-token
#
# # Cohere
# COHERE_API_KEY=your-cohere-key
#
# See: https://docs.litellm.ai/docs/providers

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# COST COMPARISON (per 1M tokens, January 2026)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Model                      Input    Output   Use Case
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# gpt-4o-mini               $0.15    $0.60    Best value, production
# gpt-4o                    $2.50    $10.00   High quality, general use
# gpt-5-mini                $0.30    $1.20    Enhanced mini model
# gpt-5                     $5.00    $20.00   Latest flagship
# o1-preview               $15.00    $60.00   Complex reasoning
#
# claude-3-haiku            $0.25    $1.25    Fast, economical
# claude-3.5-sonnet         $3.00    $15.00   Best Claude model
# claude-3-opus            $15.00    $75.00   Highest capability
#
# gemini-1.5-flash          $0.075   $0.30    Ultra-cheap
# gemini-2.0-flash          $0.10    $0.40    Latest flash
# gemini-1.5-pro            $1.25    $5.00    Best Gemini quality
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MODEL RECOMMENDATIONS BY USE CASE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# BUDGET-CONSCIOUS:
#   1st: gemini-1.5-flash    ($0.075 / $0.30)  - Cheapest
#   2nd: gpt-4o-mini         ($0.15 / $0.60)   - Proven reliability
#   3rd: claude-3-haiku      ($0.25 / $1.25)   - Fast processing
#
# BALANCED (Quality + Cost):
#   1st: gpt-4o-mini         ($0.15 / $0.60)   - Industry standard
#   2nd: gemini-2.0-flash    ($0.10 / $0.40)   - Latest Google tech
#   3rd: gpt-5-mini          ($0.30 / $1.20)   - Enhanced capabilities
#
# HIGH QUALITY:
#   1st: claude-3.5-sonnet   ($3.00 / $15.00)  - Excellent reasoning
#   2nd: gpt-4o              ($2.50 / $10.00)  - Strong all-around
#   3rd: gemini-1.5-pro      ($1.25 / $5.00)   - Good value quality
#
# COMPLEX REASONING:
#   1st: o1-preview          ($15.00 / $60.00) - Advanced reasoning
#   2nd: claude-3-opus       ($15.00 / $75.00) - Deep analysis
#   3rd: gpt-5               ($5.00 / $20.00)  - Latest capabilities
#
# LARGE DOCUMENTS:
#   1st: claude-3.5-sonnet   (200K context)    - Huge context window
#   2nd: gemini-1.5-pro      (2M context)      - Massive context
#   3rd: gpt-4o              (128K context)    - Large context
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

